 * Introduction:

  FPOFL is a frontend for TUCFGII or MBLister. It works in a way, similar to
  CNET'S own Yanktask. It has the ability to create the Filelist in the
  BACKGROUND, leaving the user to do other things while the list is being 
  generated! The user can also log off the board, and call back later!!
  
  ALL BBS data like: System name, compression method, yank path, yank date
  etc. is TAKEN DIRECTLY from CNet!!! No need for extra configs!!
  
  Has 'Visual Editor' config program, Command line arguments and several
  Sysop features!!

 
 * Installation:


  1) Makedir pfiles:FPOFL

  2) Copy the FPOFL.rexx and FPOFL2.rexx to the pfiles:FPOFL/ directory.

  3) Insert the following line in your BBSMENU, at the end of the
     '2; Available everywhere':
  
        FL   | #0PFiles:FPOFL/FPOFL.Rexx}

     Save it, and reload CNET's Text/Menus.

  4) Add the following to your CONFIG/EVENTS:

       RunARexx pfiles:FPOFL/FPOFL2.rexx M

     Set it to run on each day AFTER 24:00 similar to this example:

 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Command                                Events
  ____________   ___________________________________________________________ 
 |RunCNetC  | | |RunARexx PFiles:FPOFL/FPOFL2.rexx M                      | |
 |RunARexx  | | |                                                         | |
 |RunDOS    | | |                                                         | |
 |ReadFile  | | |                                                         |#|
 |DOS-CMD   |#| |                                                         |#|
 |ClosePrt  |#| |                                                         |#|
 |Charges#  |#| |                                                         |^|
 |LogonBPS  |^| |                                                         |v|
 |DloadBPS  |v|  ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯ 
  ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯        ____________________________________            ______
                Args |PFiles:FPOFL/FPOFL2.rexx M          |     Time |400   |
                      ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯            ¯¯¯¯¯¯
  ______              ____________________________________            ______
 |  NEW |  [port(s)] |1                                   |    Valid |10    |
  ¯¯¯¯¯¯              ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯            ¯¯¯¯¯¯
  ______              ____________________________________            ______
 |  ADD |       Type | @ |Immediate--force system idle    | Interval |0     |
  ¯¯¯¯¯¯              ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯            ¯¯¯¯¯¯
  ______              ________ ___ ___ ___ ___ ___ ___ ___            ______
 |REMOVE|    [mm/]dd |        | X | X | X | X | X | X | X |  Iterate |1     |
  ¯¯¯¯¯¯              ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯ SAT SUN MON TUE WED THU FRI            ¯¯¯¯¯¯
                       ____
                      | OK |
                       ¯¯¯¯
